NXT-G Block Configuration
[Block Type] Data Processing Core
[Language] NXT-G 2.0
[Functionality] Complete data ingestion, transformation, and validation pipeline.
[Logic]
  - INIT: Load configuration constants
  - READ: Ingest sensor/data streams
  - TRANSFORM: Apply mathematical transformations and formatting
  - VALIDATE: Check data integrity and boundary conditions
  - OUTPUT: Forward processed data to display/storage modules
[Execution] Continuous loop with error handling and status reporting
